# Mission

Interfaces that feel **international compound**: spacious, editorial, trustworthy — **CRO**-aware without shouting.

# Reference tone (not imitation)

ORA-adjacent premium, Emaar-class clarity, Sobha-level finish discipline — **own** Solana West identity.

# Visual language

- **Colors:** black, white, warm beige, restrained gold accents — no neon or loud gradients.
- **Type:** large display for hero, comfortable body size, clear H1–H3 ladder (**15**).
- **Imagery:** architectural, cinematic realism — **10**.

# Layout

Generous whitespace, strong grid, **one** focal column on mobile; avoid template stacking.

# Hero (page-level)

Cinematic visual, **clear** offer line (price/plan cues via copy — data from **01**), **primary** + **secondary** CTA (**06**), readable overlays.

# Components

Cards: **quiet** elevation; tasteful hover; typography does the work — not heavy skeuomorphism.

# Motion

Framer Motion: **subtle** entry; respect reduced motion; never block conversion.

# Navigation

Sticky, minimal, **fast**; persistent phone/WhatsApp affordances (**11**).

# Mobile

Thumb zones, **sticky** conversion bar (**06**), fast LCP hero (**13**).

# Anti-patterns

Glassmorphism clutter, **aggressive** popups, stock luxury clichés, illegible thin text on photos.

# Governance

If UI copy conflicts with **01** / **07**, **fix copy** before polishing pixels.
